# Architecture & Framework Rules

- Electron Main process logic resides in `src/main/*`.
- Renderer React components reside in `src/renderer/*`.
- Preload contextBridge methods reside in `src/preload/*`.
- Optical stream fountain coding engine resides in `src/core/*`.
- Node integration is disabled in renderer (`nodeIntegration: false`, `contextIsolation: true`, `sandbox: true`).
